1.2 "beta" - 30/06/2003
-----------------------
* New in BASS_FX:
  * Not compatible with any previous BASS_FX versions,
     you'll have to make changes & recompile your
     application to use with this version!

  + Tempo, Pitch Scaling & Samplerate changers (3 at once ;))
    + Functions:
      * BASS_FX_TempoCreate
      * BASS_FX_TempoSet
