  BASSAPE.H       BASSAPE C/C++ header file
  BASSAPE.LIB     32-bit BASSAPE import library
  X64\
    BASSAPE.LIB     64-bit BASSAPE import library
DELPHI\
  BASSAPE.PAS     BASSAPE Delphi unit
VB\
  BASSAPE.BAS     BASSAPE Visual Basic module

macOS version
